	"$comment": "The Claude Agent SDK and its provider adapter are never bundled into the board (scripts/build.mjs). `install` is the package list the board's install action (runtime.installClaudeAgentSdk) fetches, only on the user's acknowledged request: the entry with userVersion at the version the user chooses (default: its pinned version), every other entry at its pinned version. A later item can add packages (for example @clinebot/*) to this list without changing the action, its notice flow or its /state install path. `packages` pins version and integrity; every entry must equal apps/kanban/package-lock.json, and the build refuses a drift.",
